    'learn.creating-agents.what.title': 'What is an agent?',
    'learn.creating-agents.what.body': 'An **agent** is an AI assistant you shape for a specific job. Every agent has three parts:\n\n- **A system prompt** — its role, tone and rules.\n- **Tools** — the things it can actually do (email, calendar, web search…).\n- **Knowledge** — your documents it can answer from.\n\nThe quickest way to start: describe what you want in plain English and let Bee Flow draft it. Nothing is created until you submit.',
    'learn.creating-agents.studio.title': 'Studio is home base',
    'learn.creating-agents.studio.body': 'Your agents live in Studio. Each one has a system prompt, tools, and knowledge. Let’s make one.',
    'learn.creating-agents.describe.hint': '👉 Describe your agent…',
    'learn.creating-agents.describe.title': 'Describe what it should do',
    'learn.creating-agents.describe.body': 'Type a sentence, e.g. “An assistant that turns meeting notes into action items.” Then press Enter to build it.',
    'learn.creating-agents.refine.title': 'Refine, then publish',
    'learn.creating-agents.refine.body': 'Your draft is **private** until you publish it. Next, you’ll tune the system prompt, switch on tools, and attach knowledge in the **Agent Designer** — then publish to share it with your team.',
    'learn.creating-agents.quiz.q': 'Which three parts shape how an agent behaves?',
    'learn.refining-prompt.what.title': 'The three dials of an agent',
    'learn.refining-prompt.what.body': 'The **Agent Designer** is where you shape behaviour. You’ll spend most of your time on three dials:\n\n1. **System prompt** — the agent’s role, tone and rules.\n2. **Tools** — what it’s allowed to do.\n3. **Knowledge** — the documents it answers from.\n\nNext we’ll spotlight each one in the real Designer — open an agent to follow along.',
    'learn.refining-prompt.open.title': 'Open an agent',
    'learn.refining-prompt.open.body': 'Pick any agent in Studio to open its designer. The three things below are what you’ll tune most.',
    'learn.refining-prompt.system.title': 'The system prompt',
    'learn.refining-prompt.system.body': 'This sets the agent’s role, tone, and rules. Be specific: who it is, what it always/never does, and how it should respond.',
    'learn.refining-prompt.tools.title': 'Tools & integrations',
    'learn.refining-prompt.tools.body': 'Give the agent abilities — email, calendar, web search, and more — by switching on the tools it’s allowed to use.',
    'learn.refining-prompt.knowledge.title': 'Knowledge',
    'learn.refining-prompt.knowledge.body': 'Attach a knowledge base so the agent answers from your documents instead of guessing.',
